\u7919\'3fng c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f kinh doanh mua b\'e1n kh\'f4ng c\'f3 ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f ho\'e1 \'f0\'f5n v\'e0 nh\u7919\'3fng tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp vi ph\u7841\'3fm, gian l\u7853\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af374\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f374\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3374827\charrsid11883051 3. V\u7873\'3f gi\'e1 t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f TT\'d0B \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ph\'e1o.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
