\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3374827\charrsid11883051 \'fd thu thu\u7871\'3f ph\'e1o, nh\u7857\'3fm h\u7841\'3fn ch\u7871\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng ph\'e1o. B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh \u7845\'3fn }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3374827\charrsid11883051 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh gi\'e1 t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f lo\u7841\'3fi ph\'e1o s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft trong n\'fd\u7899\'3fc nh\'fd sau:
\par - Ph\'e1o b\'e1nh 180- 200 qu\u7843\'3f lo\u7841\'3fi v\u7915\'3fa kh\'f4ng c\'f3 ph\'e1o \'f0\'f9ng (c\u7889\'3fi), gi\'e1 t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f  3000 \'f0/b\'e1nh, thu\u7871\'3f ti\'eau th\u7909\'3f \'f0\u7863\'3fc bi\u7879\'3ft 3000\'f0/b\'e1nh.
\par - Ph\'e1o nh\u7887\'3f (t\'e9p) b\'e1nh d\'e0i 20 cm, gi\'e1 t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f 1000\'f0/b\'e1nh, thu\u7871\'3f ti\'eau th\u7909\'3f \'f0\u7863\'3fc bi\u7879\'3ft 1000\'f0/b\'e1nh.
\par - Ph\'e1o d\'e2y(lo\u7841\'3fi \'f0\u7889\'3ft ch\'e1y s\'e1ng kh\'f4ng g\'e2y n\u7893\'3f) d\'e2y d\'e0i 20 - 25 cm, gi\'e1 t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f 2000\'f0/100 d\'e2y, thu\u7871\'3f TT\'d0B 2000\'f0/}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3374827\charrsid11883051 100d\'e2y.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3374827\charrsid11883051 - Ph\'e1o b\'f4ng, ph\'e1o c\'e2y c\'f3 k\u7871\'3ft h\u7907\'3fp nhi\u7873\'3fu lo\u7841\'3fi ph\'e1o, nhi\u7873\'3fu qu\u7843\'3f ph\'e1o c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi c\'f3
 gi\'e1 t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh theo s\u7889\'3f l\'fd\u7907\'3fng qu\u7843\'3f ph\'e1o gi\'e1 t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f 2000\'f0/100 qu\u7843\'3f, thu\u7871\'3f TT\'d0B ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp 2000\'f0/100 qu\u7843\'3f.
\par C\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o gi\'e1 t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f lo\u7841\'3fi ph\'e1o \u7845\'3fn \'f0\u7883\'3fnh tr\'ean \'f0\'e2y, c\'e1c C\u7909\'3fc Thu\u7871\'3f quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\'e0 th\'f4ng b\'e1o gi\'e1 t\'ed
nh thu\u7871\'3f v\'e0 ti\u7873\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f TT\'d0B ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi ph\'e1o c\'f3 s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft t\u7841\'3fi \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng, m\u7913
\'3fc gi\'e1 t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f t\u7889\'3fi thi\u7875\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi b\u7857\'3fng 3 l\u7847\'3fn gi\'e1 b\'e1n t\u7841\'3fi \'d0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng. M\u7913\'3fc gi\'e1 t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f qui \'f0\u7883\'3f
nh trong Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7891\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi l\'e0m c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f \'f0\u7875\'3f x\u7917\'3f l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3374827\charrsid11883051 \'fd
 truy thu thu\u7871\'3f, x\u7917\'3f ph\u7841\'3ft v\u7873\'3f thu\u7871\'3f.
